@startuml
title 企业文件管理系统 - 验证码获取（带 key）时序图

actor 用户 as User
participant "浏览器/登录页\n(Login.vue)" as UI
participant "Axios\nrequest.js" as Axios
participant "认证控制器\nAuthController" as AuthCtrl
participant "验证码服务\nCaptchaService" as CaptchaSvc

User -> UI: 点击“显示验证码/换一张”
UI -> Axios: GET /api/auth/captcha/new
Axios -> AuthCtrl: getCaptchaNew()
AuthCtrl -> CaptchaSvc: generateCaptchaPair()
CaptchaSvc --> AuthCtrl: { key, text }
AuthCtrl -> CaptchaSvc: createCaptchaImage(text)
AuthCtrl -> AuthCtrl: 将 PNG 编码为 Base64
AuthCtrl --> Axios: 200 { key, imageBase64, expiresIn=300 }
Axios --> UI: 显示验证码图片，保存 captchaKey

note over AuthCtrl
旧接口 /api/auth/captcha 返回 PNG 图片；\n推荐使用 /api/auth/captcha/new，返回 key + base64。
end note

@enduml

